    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a tragedy, UKNON Jones, Guynelk and Elsa LOVELUST decide to meet Doctor Gamma to save their friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this open world and find all the hidden G-atoms in the world to power the time machine from the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">doctor to hope to change things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main Features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Cross this vast world with varied environments, alone or in local multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Use your different items like a drone that stuns enemies and monitors the surroundings, or the X-bomb that can create explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Face increasingly 18 difficult bosses and find their weak point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Participate in various mini-games or compete against your friends in split screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Chat with an in-game AI or scanning a QR code can reveal a character to help you defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Take advantage of certain powers such as the ability to be giant, reverse gravity or jump very high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Take photos of enemies or characters to get information about them in this game created by one person in 7 years.</p>",
